OL,3,AFrance targets Shein and Temu with fast
OL,4,Afashion fees
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrance has started imposing fees on
OL,7,Ffast fashion items which could reach
OL,8,Falmost bB,20 per garment by 2030, as
OL,9,Fthe government tries to curb sales of
OL,10,Fcheap clothing sold by e-commerce
OL,11,Fsites.
OL,13,FThe levy, which came into force on
OL,14,FTuesday, follows a new law passed in
OL,15,FJune to regulate so-called "ultra-fast
OL,16,Ffashion" companies such as Shein, Temu
OL,17,Fand AliExpress.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
