OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFrance targets Shein and Temu with fast
OL,4,Afashion fees
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe e-commerce giants, known for
OL,7,Fselling large volumes of cheap apparel,
OL,8,Fhave been criticised by French
OL,9,Fofficials for driving a surge in fast
OL,10,Ffashion.
OL,12,FChina's commerce ministry has described
OL,13,Fthe French law as discriminatory and a
OL,14,Ftrade barrier, saying it could violate
OL,15,FWorld Trade Organization (WTO)
OL,16,Fprinciples.
